{
  "title": "WAF / Shield · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "웹 요청 필터링과 DDoS 방어를 구별한다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>WAF <span class=\"full-name\">(Web Application Firewall)</span> / Shield</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#web-acls-and-rules\">Web ACLs and Rules</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#allow-block-count-captcha-and-challenge\">Allow, Block, Count, CAPTCHA and Challenge</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#managed-rule-groups\">Managed Rule Groups</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#rate-based-rules-and-ip-sets\">Rate-based Rules and IP Sets</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#scope-logging-and-firewall-manager\">Scope, Logging and Firewall Manager</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#shield-standard\">Shield Standard</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#shield-advanced\">Shield Advanced</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>보안</span><span>61 / 62</span></div><h1>WAF <span class=\"full-name\">(Web Application Firewall)</span> / Shield</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 7 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> WAF <span class=\"full-name\">(Web Application Firewall)</span>는 HTTP(S) 요청을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#web-acls-and-rules\">Web ACL</a> Rule로 검사한다. AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Shield는 DDoS <span class=\"full-name\">(Distributed Denial of Service)</span> 보호를 제공한다. Application 요청 패턴과 Network·Transport 공격은 서로 다른 계층의 문제이므로 필요한 보호를 조합한다.</p><p>WAF <span class=\"full-name\">(Web Application Firewall)</span>를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a> 등 지원 리소스에 연결하고 정상 요청 영향부터 관찰한다. 규칙을 만든다는 사실만으로 잘못된 앱 인증이나 모든 취약점이 해결되는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Application 보호와 DDoS 보호\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Application 보호와 DDoS 보호</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>HTTP request inspection</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Client request</strong><small>URI·Header·Body</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>WAF <span class=\"full-name\">(Web Application Firewall)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#web-acls-and-rules\">Web ACL</a></strong><small>Rule·Rate·Managed Group</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Allow / Block / Challenge</strong><small>정상 사용자 영향 확인</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>DDoS response</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Attack traffic</strong><small>Network·Transport 위협</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#shield-standard\">Shield Standard</a> / Advanced</strong><small>보호·지원 범위 선택</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Protected resource</strong><small>탐지·완화·Health 관찰</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\"><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>의 Port Rule만으로 SQL Injection Payload를 검사하지 않는다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"web-acls-and-rules\"><h2>Web ACLs <span class=\"full-name\">(Access Control Lists)</span> and Rules<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#web-acls-and-rules\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#web-acls-and-rules\">Web ACL</a>은 우선순위 Rule과 Default Action을 가진다. IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>·Header·URI·Body 등 지원 부분을 Match한다. Rule 평가 순서와 Terminating Action 때문에 뒤 규칙이 실행되지 않을 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"allow-block-count-captcha-and-challenge\"><h2>Allow, Block, Count, CAPTCHA <span class=\"full-name\">(Completely Automated Public Turing test to tell Computers and Humans Apart)</span> and Challenge<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#allow-block-count-captcha-and-challenge\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Allow·Block은 허용·차단, Count는 관찰에 사용한다. CAPTCHA <span class=\"full-name\">(Completely Automated Public Turing test to tell Computers and Humans Apart)</span>·Challenge는 사람·Client 검증을 요구하는 지원 동작이다. 신규 Rule은 Count와 Log로 정상 사용자 영향을 확인한 뒤 적용한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"managed-rule-groups\"><h2>Managed Rule Groups<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#managed-rule-groups\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>·Marketplace의 관리 Rule을 사용해 SQL Injection·XSS·Bot 등 지원 공격 패턴을 탐지한다. 예외·Version·추가 비용을 검토한다. 관리 Rule도 앱 특성에 따른 False Positive 조정이 필요하다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"rate-based-rules-and-ip-sets\"><h2>Rate-based Rules and IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> Sets<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#rate-based-rules-and-ip-sets\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Rate-based Rule은 집계 Key별 요청 빈도로 대응한다. IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> Set·Geo Match 등으로 접근 조건을 구성한다. 정밀한 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 사용자별 Quota나 Billing 제한과 동일한 기능으로 생각하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"scope-logging-and-firewall-manager\"><h2>Scope, Logging and Firewall Manager<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#scope-logging-and-firewall-manager\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a> Global Scope와 Regional 리소스 Scope를 구분한다. Logging·Sampled Request로 결과를 확인하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#scope-logging-and-firewall-manager\">Firewall Manager</a>로 조직의 정책 배포를 중앙 관리할 수 있다. Body 검사 크기·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#scope-logging-and-firewall-manager\">WCU</a>·리소스 지원 조건을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"shield-standard\"><h2>Shield Standard<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#shield-standard\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>지원 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 리소스에 기본 제공되는 DDoS <span class=\"full-name\">(Distributed Denial of Service)</span> 방어다. Network·Transport 계층의 일반 공격 보호를 제공한다. 앱의 SQL Injection·Business Logic 악용은 WAF <span class=\"full-name\">(Web Application Firewall)</span>·앱 보안이 별도로 필요하다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"shield-advanced\"><h2>Shield Advanced<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#shield-advanced\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>구독 기반으로 강화된 탐지·대응·지원 및 조건부 비용 보호를 제공한다. 보호할 리소스와 Health Check·Response Team 지원 조건을 확인한다. 모든 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 비용이 무조건 면제되는 보험으로 이해하지 않는다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a>에 WAF <span class=\"full-name\">(Web Application Firewall)</span> Managed Rules와 Rate-based Rule을 적용하고 Count Log로 조정한다. 중요한 서비스는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#shield-advanced\">Shield Advanced</a>의 대응·비용 보호 조건을 함께 검토한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>의 포트 허용 규칙만으로 SQL 인젝션 패턴을 판별하지 않는다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/waf/latest/developerguide/what-is-aws-waf.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">waf/latest/developerguide/what-is-aws-waf.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/waf/latest/developerguide/shield-chapter.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">waf/latest/developerguide/shield-chapter.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q066/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q066\" data-question=\"Q066\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q066</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q066/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to filter SQL injection patterns and excessive HTTP requests before they reach an ALB. Which service is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q066\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS STS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q066\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q066\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q066\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS WAF</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF</a>가 웹 요청의 규칙·속도 기반 필터링에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF / Shield</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q067\" data-question=\"Q067\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q067</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q067/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Protection against large-scale DDoS attacks is the primary requirement. Which AWS service family should be considered?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q067\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS DataSync</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q067\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q067\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Shield</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q067\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon RDS Proxy</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">Shield</a>는 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>의 DDoS <span class=\"full-name\">(Distributed Denial of Service)</span> 보호 서비스다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF</a>는 웹 요청 필터링에 맞춘다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF / Shield</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q090\" data-question=\"Q090\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q090</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q090/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO services should be considered to mitigate malicious web requests and DDoS attacks in front of CloudFront?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q090\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Shield</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q090\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS WAF</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q090\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q090\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q090\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS DMS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF</a>는 웹 요청 규칙, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">Shield</a>는 DDoS <span class=\"full-name\">(Distributed Denial of Service)</span> 보호에 중점을 둔다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF / Shield</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q097\" data-question=\"Q097\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q097</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q097/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An ALB must terminate browser HTTPS connections using a certificate that is issued and renewed as a managed service. What should be attached?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q097\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q097\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q097\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q097\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An ACM certificate</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">ACM</a>은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a> 같은 통합 서비스에서 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">TLS</a> 인증서를 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">ACM</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q003\" data-question=\"Q003\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q003</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q003/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to reduce static image download latency for users worldwide and lower requests to its origin server. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q003\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon RDS Multi-AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q003\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q003\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q003\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS snapshots</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a>가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/\">엣지</a>에 콘텐츠를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">캐시</a>해 사용자 가까이 전달한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/\">Edge Location</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">이전 용어 <b>VPN / Direct Connect</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/well/\">다음 용어 <b>Well-Architected</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
